{"pages":[{"h":792,"segs":[["BUILDING A MOVEMENT:",151.90000000000001,33.948599999999942,560.62800000000016,112.00059999999996,76,false],["FUNDING FIRST",151.90000000000001,93.912599999999998,412.73199999999997,171.96460000000002,76,false],["STEP 1",151.90000000000001,164.61259999999993,207.46000000000001,190.93259999999998,20,false],["BEFORE THE SCHOOL YEAR",145.40000000000001,227.04970000000003,234.51499999999999,242.4547,15,false],["It’s hard to envision building a movement with a bank",145.40000000000001,242.5696999999999,345.45200000000011,254.97169999999994,9,false],["account of zero. Not that it can’t be done, but why",145.40000000000001,255.56569999999988,329.10800000000006,267.96769999999992,9,false],["would you even attempt it. Materials cost money,",145.40000000000001,268.56169999999997,328.53200000000004,280.96369999999996,9,false],["retreats cost money, socials cost money—heck, it costs",145.40000000000001,281.55769999999995,348.53000000000009,293.95969999999994,9,false],["gas just to drive to campus.",145.40000000000001,294.55369999999994,245.98400000000001,306.95569999999992,9,false],["Before the start of the school year is a good time to",145.40000000000001,320.55469999999991,332.80700000000013,332.9566999999999,9,false],["attend to raising money for the ministry. It’s the one",145.40000000000001,333.55069999999989,338.90000000000009,345.95269999999988,9,false],["activity that can be taken out of the hectic flow of",145.40000000000001,346.54669999999987,328.59500000000003,358.94869999999986,9,false],["events in that first semester.",145.40000000000001,359.54269999999985,251.12300000000002,371.94469999999984,9,false],["Whether a staff member or a volunteer, Campus",145.40000000000001,385.54369999999983,324.68000000000006,397.94569999999982,9,false],["Crusade allows you to raise money for your campus.",145.40000000000001,398.53969999999981,339.20600000000002,410.9416999999998,9,false],["And the most effective thing you can do is to put",145.40000000000001,411.53569999999979,324.1400000000001,423.93769999999978,9,false],["together an overview of your ministry as well as your",145.40000000000001,424.53169999999977,342.59900000000005,436.93369999999976,9,false],["financial need for the up-coming year. What you’ll find",145.40000000000001,437.52769999999975,348.41300000000007,449.92969999999974,9,false],["attached is an example of such an overview.",145.40000000000001,450.52369999999974,307.84099999999989,462.92569999999972,9,false],["B U I L D I N G M OV E M E N TS 1",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,606.57799999999997,9,false],["This is what you would use to mail to or to meet",145.40000000000001,476.52469999999971,322.87100000000009,488.9266999999997,9,false],["with a Christian who may have a heart to contribute",145.40000000000001,489.52069999999969,339.67400000000009,501.92269999999968,9,false],["to what God is doing on campus. Of course, if you’ve",145.40000000000001,502.51669999999967,338.03599999999994,514.91869999999972,9,false],["been ministering on that campus for awhile the most",145.40000000000001,515.51269999999965,342.94100000000014,527.91469999999958,9,false],["likely candidates will be alumni. If you don’t know any",145.40000000000001,528.50869999999964,347.61200000000008,540.91069999999968,9,false],["alumni then the most logical place to go would be local",145.40000000000001,541.50469999999973,348.26900000000001,553.90669999999966,9,false],["churches in the area. Pray about it. God will give you",145.40000000000001,554.5006999999996,340.21400000000006,566.90269999999964,9,false],["some good ideas on who to approach. But take the time",145.40000000000001,567.49669999999969,349.52900000000011,579.89869999999974,9,false],["to create an overview of the ministry that you can use",145.40000000000001,580.49269999999967,344.49800000000005,592.89469999999972,9,false],["to share with those to whom God leads you.",145.40000000000001,593.48869999999965,306.95899999999995,605.8906999999997,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76200660000006,778.43721970000001,9,false]],"w":612,"ocr":false},{"h":792,"w":612,"ocr":false,"segs":[["To Think About:",44.349820000000001,599.29369999999994,59.238700000000016,744.22969999999998,21.960000000000001,false],["1.",76.649500000000003,750.83169999999996,85.019500000000008,757.6807,9,false],["Over 110,000,000 college students in the world…",76.649500000000003,570.5166999999999,85.019500000000022,739.68970000000002,9,false],["2.",106.04950000000001,750.83169999999996,114.41950000000001,757.6807,9,false],["There are 70,000 college students on 25 campuses",106.04950000000001,565.45869999999991,114.41950000000003,739.68970000000002,9,false],["within the SC Lowcountry, and many of these",126.4495,588.49469999999997,134.81950000000001,739.67669999999998,9,false],["campuses have no organized outreach or small group",146.84950000000001,559.49169999999981,155.21950000000004,739.6807,9,false],["Bible studies.",167.24950000000001,692.84469999999999,175.61950000000002,739.6807,9,false],["Thank you so much in advance for your",37.476819999999996,323.55093999999985,46.450780000000009,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["interest in our ministry. Please feel free",49.116819999999997,323.30193999999983,58.090780000000009,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["to call or write us with any questions you",60.636819999999993,318.17254000000003,69.610780000000005,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["have regarding our ministry and how",72.156819999999982,335.05474000000004,81.130780000000001,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["you can be a part, whether it would be",83.676819999999978,330.13449999999989,92.650779999999997,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["through your time, your prayers or your",95.196819999999974,324.17841999999996,104.17077999999999,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["finances.",106.71681999999997,447.38361999999995,115.69077999999998,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["If you would like to make a contribution",130.35681999999997,321.1904199999999,139.33077999999998,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["to our ministry, you may send it to",141.99681999999996,344.82549999999992,150.97077999999996,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["Campus Crusade for Christ at P.O. Box",153.51681999999997,324.64653999999996,162.49077999999997,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["628222 Orlando, FL 32862-8222.",165.03681999999998,342.76377999999988,174.01077999999998,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["Please make any checks payable to",176.55681999999999,342.87333999999987,185.53077999999999,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["Campus Crusade for Christ and",187.52950000000001,347.09770000000003,197.17078000000001,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["include our account number (#2791061)",199.59682000000001,322.00713999999994,208.57078000000001,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["on the memo line of the check. This will",211.11682000000002,318.81993999999997,220.09078000000002,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["ensure that your gift will be designated",222.63682000000003,327.17637999999988,231.61078000000003,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["to our ministry in the SC Lowcountry.",234.15682000000004,330.2838999999999,243.13078000000004,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["Thanks again!",245.67682000000005,426.26841999999999,254.65078000000005,483.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["CAMPUS",136.22558000000001,117.16915999999992,153.88070000000002,231.12019999999995,26.039999999999999,false],["CRUSADE",165.50558000000001,98.159959999999955,183.16070000000002,231.12019999999995,26.039999999999999,false],["FOR CHRIST",194.78558000000001,60.401959999999917,212.44070000000005,231.12019999999995,26.039999999999999,false],["Campus Crusade for Christ International is a",291.75682000000006,339.32409999999987,300.73078000000004,501.12009999999998,9.9600000000000009,false],["charter member of the Evangelical Council for",302.97250000000003,333.14409999999992,311.08150000000001,501.12009999999998,9,false],["Financial Accountability and was recognized by",313.29250000000002,327.27609999999993,321.40150000000006,501.12009999999998,9,false],["Money magazine as one of the top charities in the",323.61250000000001,322.7670999999998,331.72150000000005,501.12009999999998,9,false],["nation in terms of program spending as a",333.9325,353.85309999999993,342.04149999999998,501.12009999999998,9,false],["percentage of income.",344.2525,421.47009999999995,352.36149999999998,501.12009999999998,9,false],["3.",196.64950000000002,750.83169999999996,205.01950000000002,757.6807,9,false],["College campuses are full of anti-Christian professors",196.64950000000002,556.76470000000006,205.01950000000005,739.68970000000002,9,false],["and new age groups that look attractive on the surface",217.04950000000002,554.82969999999989,225.41950000000006,739.6807,9,false],["to a college student. College students today are",237.44950000000003,575.98869999999988,245.81950000000003,739.6807,9,false],["searching for truth.",257.84950000000003,673.74670000000003,266.21950000000004,739.6807,9,false],["About Us:",287.24950000000001,722.97270000000003,295.61950000000002,757.67669999999998,9,false],["Chad received a B.S. in Textile Chemistry from",313.04950000000002,583.95369999999991,321.41950000000003,739.6807,9,false],["Clemson University and an M.S. in Chemical",323.84950000000003,590.28070000000002,332.21950000000004,739.6807,9,false],["Engineering from Georgia Tech. Elizabeth also",334.04950000000002,581.97370000000001,342.41950000000003,739.6807,9,false],["attended Clemson and received a B.S. in Elementary",344.24950000000001,560.49069999999995,352.61950000000002,739.6807,9,false],["Education from Ohio University. They have been",354.4495,578.00469999999996,362.81950000000001,739.6807,9,false],["married 9 years, and they have a 5 year old son named",364.64949999999999,555.07269999999994,373.01949999999999,739.6807,9,false],["Wyatt and a 2 year old named Clark.",374.84949999999998,617.69069999999999,383.21949999999998,739.67669999999998,9,false],["Kurt Brewer is a graduate of the University of South",395.48949999999996,566.32269999999994,403.85949999999997,739.6807,9,false],["Carolina, and his wife Morgan is a graduate of",406.28949999999998,583.51269999999988,414.65949999999998,739.6807,9,false],["Marshall University. They have been married for 2",416.48949999999996,571.08369999999991,424.85949999999997,739.6807,9,false],["years.",426.68949999999995,719.12969999999996,435.05949999999996,739.67669999999998,9,false],["Rebecca Buchanan is a graduate of the University of",447.32949999999994,562.14670000000001,455.69949999999994,739.6807,9,false],["Tennessee. She was a violin teacher for 2 years before",458.12949999999995,555.26670000000001,466.49949999999995,739.67669999999998,9,false],["she joined staff with Campus Crusade for Christ.",468.32949999999994,575.52970000000005,476.69949999999994,739.6807,9,false],["We are a team of 5 full-time staff serving in",488.96949999999993,588.78269999999998,497.33949999999993,739.67669999999998,9,false],["Charleston, SC, where we are partnering with local",499.76949999999994,568.15869999999995,508.13949999999994,739.6807,9,false],["churches, volunteers, alumni, and student leaders to",509.96949999999993,560.74270000000001,518.33949999999993,739.6807,9,false],["develop ministries on 25 local college campuses.",520.16949999999997,572.95569999999998,528.53949999999998,739.6807,9,false],["There are 70,000 college students on the campuses",530.36950000000002,563.39369999999985,538.73950000000002,739.67669999999998,9,false],["within our scope.",540.56950000000006,681.55470000000003,548.93950000000007,739.67669999999998,9,false],["Chad and Elizabeth Young Chad and Elizabeth Young Chad and Elizabeth Young Chad and Elizabeth Young",472.88950000000006,392.64241999999996,482.41222000000005,503.54324000000003,9.9600000000000009,false],["CCC Directors of the SC Lowcountry CCC Directors of the SC Lowcountry CCC Directors of the SC Lowcountry CCC Directors of the SC Lowcountry",487.04950000000008,358.46069999999992,496.57222000000007,512.08991999999989,9.9600000000000009,false],["1304 Woodpecker Lane 1304 Woodpecker Lane 1304 Woodpecker Lane 1304 Woodpecker Lane",501.20950000000011,399.84449999999987,510.7322200000001,501.97305,9.9600000000000009,false],["Hanahan, SC 29406 Hanahan, SC 29406 Hanahan, SC 29406 Hanahan, SC 29406",515.36950000000002,410.3433399999999,524.89222000000007,498.83166999999992,9.9600000000000009,false],["Phone: 843 Phone: 843Phone: 843 Phone: 843- - -323 32323 323- - -7415 74157415 7415",535.8895,403.02937999999989,545.41222000000005,491.02900999999991,9.9600000000000009,false],["Email: chad.young@uscm.org Email: chad.young@uscm.org Email: chad.young@uscm.org Email: chad.young@uscm.org",550.04949999999997,380.41553999999991,559.57222000000002,507.58103999999992,9.9600000000000009,false],["We also have a part time staff lady, Melisa Hodgins,",561.20950000000005,564.37469999999985,569.57950000000005,739.67669999999998,9,false],["who joined our team in January of ‘07.",572.0095,611.57069999999999,580.37950000000001,739.67669999999998,9,false],["“Helping to Turn Lost Students into",302.78966000000003,54.433759999999893,315.53798,227.28019999999992,14.040000000000001,false],["Christ-Centered Laborers”",318.50966000000005,78.242600000000039,331.25798000000003,203.76019999999994,14.040000000000001,false],["SC Lowcountry Staff Team SC Lowcountry Staff Team SC Lowcountry Staff Team SC Lowcountry Staff Team",532.10980000000006,53.278344383999865,545.40700000000004,252.71876644799988,14.219712000000001,false],["Serving in Charleston, SC Serving in Charleston, SC Serving in Charleston, SC Serving in Charleston, SC",546.9298,88.816000799999983,555.53980000000001,202.58499704999997,9.1399500000000007,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",586.03521969999997,294.23802389999992,598.43721970000001,497.76202389999997,9,false]]},{"ocr":false,"w":612,"h":792,"segs":[["The Campus Ministry",91.117439999999974,551.54782097962504,118.32996693600002,741.58066018359375,20.040516,false],["Our Objectives…",131.93269999999998,666.15314000000001,141.49333999999999,741.60050000000001,11.040000000000001,false],["1.",159.1199,734.07650000000001,166.91390000000001,741.60050000000001,9,false],["To help expose every person on the college",159.1199,560.4844999999998,166.91390000000001,723.60950000000003,9,false],["campuses today (over 65 million) to the",176.9999,572.96749999999997,184.79390000000001,723.60050000000001,9,false],["gospel.",194.87989999999999,696.51049999999998,202.6739,723.60050000000001,9,false],["2.",218.75989999999999,734.07650000000001,226.79390000000001,741.60050000000001,9,false],["To help win winwin win people to faith in Jesus Christ.",218.75989999999999,564.24350000000004,226.79390000000001,723.60950000000003,9,false],["3.",242.63989999999998,734.07650000000001,250.6739,741.60050000000001,9,false],["To help build buildbuild build them in their faith.",242.63989999999998,602.52949999999998,250.6739,723.60950000000003,9,false],["4.",266.51990000000001,734.07650000000001,274.5539,741.60050000000001,9,false],["To help train traintrain train them for the ministry.",266.51990000000001,592.5535000000001,274.5539,723.60950000000003,9,false],["5.",291.05270000000007,732.36001999999996,300.61334000000005,741.60050000000001,11.040000000000001,false],["To help send sendsend send them to win and disciple",291.05270000000007,580.40750000000003,300.61334000000005,723.60050000000001,9,false],["others.",312.23990000000003,697.0865,320.03390000000002,723.60050000000001,9,false],["Our Emphasis…",336.7727000000001,668.67025999999998,346.33334000000008,741.60050000000001,11.040000000000001,false],["1.",363.95990000000006,734.07650000000001,371.75390000000004,741.60050000000001,9,false],["Total Commitment to the Great Commission",363.95990000000006,557.40650000000005,371.75390000000004,723.60950000000003,9,false],["(Matthew 28:18-20).",381.83990000000006,644.46349999999995,389.63390000000004,723.60050000000001,9,false],["2.",405.71990000000005,734.07650000000001,413.51390000000004,741.60050000000001,9,false],["Dependence on the Holy Spirit, prayer, and",405.71990000000005,560.93449999999996,413.51390000000004,723.60950000000003,9,false],["God’s inspired Word.",423.59990000000005,644.66149999999993,431.39390000000003,723.60050000000001,9,false],["3.",447.47990000000004,734.07650000000001,455.27390000000003,741.60050000000001,9,false],["Realization of the Lordship of Christ—that",447.47990000000004,566.9375,455.27390000000003,723.60950000000003,9,false],["Jesus is preeminent in our lives and",465.35990000000004,587.69150000000002,473.15390000000002,723.60050000000001,9,false],["ministries and merits our full allegiance.",483.23990000000003,571.5184999999999,491.03390000000002,723.60050000000001,9,false],["4.",507.11990000000003,734.07650000000001,514.91390000000001,741.60050000000001,9,false],["Training with transferable methods and",507.11990000000003,574.3264999999999,514.91390000000001,723.60950000000003,9,false],["materials through which learners become",524.99990000000003,565.95650000000001,532.79390000000001,723.60050000000001,9,false],["teachers, and spiritual multiplication",542.87990000000002,584.99649999999997,550.6739,723.59649999999999,9,false],["continues.",560.75990000000002,684.01850000000002,568.5539,723.60050000000001,9,false],["WHAT IS CAMPUS CRUSADE",91.117439999999988,293.31670000000003,118.32996693600003,502.08009999999996,14.040000000000001,false],["FOR CHRIST?",114.75743999999999,401.78542000000004,127.53384000000001,502.08010000000002,14.040000000000001,false],["Campus Crusade for Christ is an interde-",138.30719999999999,295.58937999999989,146.93256,466.08465999999999,9.9600000000000009,false],["nominational ministry committed to helping",158.10720000000001,319.21450000000004,166.73256000000001,502.08010000000002,9.9600000000000009,false],["people take the gospel of Jesus Christ to all",177.90720000000002,318.95554000000004,186.53256000000002,502.08010000000002,9.9600000000000009,false],["nations. Working together with Christians from",197.70720000000003,304.46373999999992,206.33256000000003,502.08010000000002,9.9600000000000009,false],["churches of many denominations and hundreds",217.50720000000004,300.56937999999991,226.13256000000004,502.08010000000002,9.9600000000000009,false],["of other Christian organizations around the world,",237.30720000000005,293.58742000000001,245.93256000000005,502.08010000000002,9.9600000000000009,false],["our goal is to give every man, woman and child in",257.10720000000003,295.13121999999993,265.73256000000009,502.08010000000002,9.9600000000000009,false],["the world an opportunity to find new life in Jesus",276.90720000000005,298.76161999999999,285.5325600000001,502.07510000000002,9.9600000000000009,false],["Christ. Our commitment is based upon the Lord’s",296.70720000000006,293.00973999999997,305.33256000000011,502.08010000000002,9.9600000000000009,false],["command:",316.50720000000007,457.33978000000002,325.13256000000007,502.08010000000002,9.9600000000000009,false],["“All authority has been given to Me in heaven",355.17000000000007,294.17110000000002,363.62100000000015,466.08010000000002,9,false],["and earth. Go therefore and make disciples of all",373.05000000000007,313.80910000000006,381.50100000000015,502.08010000000002,9,false],["nations, baptizing them in the name of the Father, and",390.93000000000006,294.62109999999996,399.38100000000014,502.08010000000002,9,false],["the Son, and the Holy Spirit, teaching them to observe",408.81000000000006,296.6821000000001,417.26100000000014,502.08010000000002,9,false],["all that I commanded you; and lo I am with you always,",426.69000000000005,294.5761,435.14100000000013,502.08010000000002,9,false],["even to the end of the age.” (Matthew 28:18-20)",444.57000000000005,315.05110000000002,453.02100000000013,502.08010000000002,9,false],["Campus Crusade for Christ holds to the",483.18720000000002,300.43990000000002,491.81256000000008,466.08465999999999,9.9600000000000009,false],["historic beliefs of the Christian faith, including the",502.98720000000003,292.92009999999988,511.61256000000009,502.08010000000002,9.9600000000000009,false],["authority of the Scripture, the Lordship of Christ,",522.7872000000001,299.33434000000005,531.4125600000001,502.08010000000002,9.9600000000000009,false],["and salvation based on the death and",542.58720000000005,339.80181999999996,551.21256000000005,502.08010000000002,9.9600000000000009,false],["resurrection of Christ.",562.38720000000001,410.84650000000005,571.01256000000001,502.08010000000002,9.9600000000000009,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",586.03521969999997,294.23802389999992,598.43721970000001,497.76202389999997,9,false],["HOW YOU CAN BE A PART",91.117440000000002,61.531399999999849,103.89384000000001,240.12019999999995,14.040000000000001,false],["Like many other mission organizations,",138.15732,81.626719999999978,147.13128000000003,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,false],["Campus Crusade for Christ depends upon the",155.43732,58.55935999999997,164.41128000000003,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,false],["consistent financial support of concerned",172.71732,75.770239999999831,181.69128000000003,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,false],["individuals and churches. These contributions",189.99732,54.067399999999907,198.97128000000004,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,false],["are used to fund the ministries of the staff",207.27732,73.47943999999984,216.25128000000004,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,false],["members.",224.55732,201.14671999999996,233.53128000000001,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,false],["If you would like to be a part of our",275.85000000000008,88.001119999999901,285.37176000000005,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,true],["ministry reaching students on college",293.13000000000005,81.746239999999943,302.65176000000002,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,true],["campuses, will you consider making an",310.41000000000003,74.027239999999892,319.93176,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,true],["annual commitment of $500, $1000, $2,500",327.69,58.409959999999955,337.21175999999997,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,true],["or some other amount?",344.96999999999997,141.06799999999998,354.49175999999994,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,true],["-Those who commit to a monthly amount will",397.35732000000002,56.029520000000048,406.33127999999999,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,false],["be sent a receipt each month for your taxes",414.63731999999999,68.599040000000059,423.61127999999997,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,false],["along with an envelope for your next contribu-",431.91731999999996,53.330359999999928,440.89127999999994,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,false],["tion. Electronic Funds Transfer from a bank",449.19731999999993,61.866080000000011,458.17127999999991,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,false],["account is also available.",466.47731999999991,140.29111999999986,475.45127999999988,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,false],["Thank you for considering how you can help",501.03731999999985,60.531439999999975,510.01127999999983,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,false],["us in reaching college students with the gospel!",518.31731999999977,50.422039999999924,527.2912799999998,240.12019999999995,9.9600000000000009,false]]}]}